#: pages/links.php:3
msgid ""
"We are providing on this page direct links to all the pages of the WBS that "
"you need for configuring and using the forms on the website. <br/>To add a "
"form into a post or a page, you can add it directly when editing the post or "
"page. <br/>To use the page as a widget on themes that allow widgets, you can "
"use the &quot;Free Forms &amp; CRM&quot; widget."
msgstr ""

